The Zendure firmware trusts only brokers under the EMQ RootCA, so the own broker presents this
certificate. The key is public: anyone on the LAN can pose as a broker with it. That holds for every
broker the devices use; keep the devices on their own network where possible. Valid until 6 May 2030.
